       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. P15INTRIN.
      *
      * Phase 2 corpus target: intrinsic functions - UPPER-CASE,
      * LENGTH, NUMVAL, MOD, MAX, REVERSE.
      *
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TEXT             PIC X(10) VALUE 'hello'.
       01  WS-UPPER            PIC X(10).
       01  WS-LEN-FIELD        PIC 9(2).
       01  WS-LEN-LITERAL      PIC 9(2).
       01  WS-NUMVAL-SRC       PIC X(10) VALUE '-123.45'.
       01  WS-NUMVAL-RESULT    PIC S9(3)V99.
       01  WS-MOD-POS          PIC S9(3).
       01  WS-MOD-NEG          PIC S9(3).
       01  WS-MAX-RESULT       PIC 9(3).
       01  WS-REVERSE-SRC      PIC X(5) VALUE 'ABCDE'.
       01  WS-REVERSE-RESULT   PIC X(5).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(WS-TEXT) TO WS-UPPER
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(WS-TEXT) TO WS-LEN-FIELD
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH('HELLO') TO WS-LEN-LITERAL
           MOVE FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-NUMVAL-SRC) TO WS-NUMVAL-RESULT
           COMPUTE WS-MOD-POS = FUNCTION MOD(17, 5)
           COMPUTE WS-MOD-NEG = FUNCTION MOD(-7, 3)
           COMPUTE WS-MAX-RESULT = FUNCTION MAX(45, 78, 12)
           MOVE FUNCTION REVERSE(WS-REVERSE-SRC) TO WS-REVERSE-RESULT
           DISPLAY 'UPPER=' WS-UPPER
           DISPLAY 'LEN-FIELD=' WS-LEN-FIELD
           DISPLAY 'LEN-LITERAL=' WS-LEN-LITERAL
           DISPLAY 'NUMVAL-RESULT=' WS-NUMVAL-RESULT
           DISPLAY 'MOD-POS=' WS-MOD-POS
           DISPLAY 'MOD-NEG=' WS-MOD-NEG
           DISPLAY 'MAX-RESULT=' WS-MAX-RESULT
           DISPLAY 'REVERSE-RESULT=' WS-REVERSE-RESULT
           STOP RUN.
